    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzuri kumlomba Isaya njama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya Mzuri Hezekia kusikira malagho ghawo, ukarashua nguwo rake kwa wasi, ukakurusha nguwo ra magunia, na kughenda Hekalunyi kwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawiduma Eliakimu uo orekoghe m'baa wa nyumba ya mzuri, na Shebna uo orekoghe muandiki na wakohani wabaa wirwae nguwo ra magunia, wighende kwa Isaya mwana wa Amozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikaghenda na kumzera, “Hezekia waghamba, ‘Idime ni ituku ja wasi, na kurashwa, na kusowelwa ishima; wana wakaia tayari kuvalwa ela ndighi rekumba lufu nderiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kewada BWANA Mlungu wako wameria kusikira malagho ghaghorwa ni Rabshake agho wadumwa ni bwana wake mzuri wa Waashuru, ghemsholia Mlungu uko moyo; nao ughikemie agho malagho ghake. Kwa huwo, kumlombe Mlungu kwa wundu ghwa masighariko gha wandu wisigharikie.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji awo wabaa wa kazi wa Mzuri Hezekia wacha kwa Isaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya ukaghamba, “Mzerenyi bwana onyu huwu, BWANA waghamba, ‘Kusakeobua kwa wundu ghwa agho malagho kwaghisikira seji nasholelwa ni wadumiki wa mzuri wa Waashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ola nichamngiria roho esikiria na kurumiria malagho gha tee, nao uchawuya isangenyi kwake, na aho uchabwaghwa kwa lufu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waashuru kukumba wandu wa Jerusalemu wowa sena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'baa wa Waashuru ukasikira kukaia mzuri wafuma Lakishi kwendalwa na muzi ghuko kaavui ghwa Libna; ukaghenda kumlomba njama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malagho ghikawivikia Waashuru kukaia majeshi gha Misri ghawuyalongozwa ni Mzuri Tirhaka wa Ethiopia, ghawuyacha kulwa nawo. Mzuri uendasikira huwo, ukaduma barua kwa Mzuri Hezekia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa Juda kumzera, “Uo Mlungu kwawuyamrumiria wei wakuzerie kedi ndekuchaangia mikonunyi kwapo kungi usekukalie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwamerie, kusikira seji mzuri wa Waashuru ubonyagha kwa kula isanga ukundagha kujitotesha. Welee, oho kufufunuka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokala wandu wapo weretoteshereghe mizi ya Gozani, Harani, na Rezefu; ukabwagha wandu wa Beth-edeni werekoghe Telasa, na milungu yawo ingi ndeerewikirieghe anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weko hao wazuri wa mizi ya Hamathi, Arpadi, Sefavaimu, Hena na Iva?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi ja Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Mzuri Hezekia waiwada iyo barua kufuma kwa wadumiki wa mzuri wa Waashuru, ukaishoma. Niko Hezekia ukaghenda Hekalunyi kwa BWANA na kuiwika iyo barua imbiri ya BWANA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukamlomba BWANA ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee BWANA wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli, kukaiagha aighu ya kifumbi cha nguma naighu ya makerubi; ni oho kuekeri Mlungu kuko aighu ya mawuzuri ghose gha ndoenyi, na ni oho kuumbie mlungunyi na ndoenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 25.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Degha madu ghako ee BWANA, kusikire madedo ghose gha Senakeribu ghekusholia oho Mlungu kuko moyo; zighana kuwone ee BWANA seji wawuyabonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa loli mzuri wa Waashuru wakabie mbari rose ra wandu na masanga ghawo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao wakorie milungu yawo nayo ni kazi ya mikonu ya wadamu, ya midi na magho; niko oredimieghe kuinona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo idana ee BWANA Mlungu odu, kudikire usedikabe, eri mawuzuri ghose gha ndoenyi ghipate kumanya kukaia ni oho kuekeri kuko BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wudumwa ghwa Isaya kwa Mzuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Isaya mwana wa Amozi ukaduma malagho kwa Mzuri Hezekia kunughana na malombi ghake ukighamba, “BWANA uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu: Kwa kukaia kwanilomba ini aighu ya madedo gha Senakeribu mzuri wa Waashuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilagho japo jetumbulia aighu yake ni iji:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya ukamzera Hezekia, “Ihi niyo ichaakaia alama yako: Mwaka ughu na ghuja ghuchagha mchaja ivo vindo vichaabuka veni; niko mwaka ghwa kadadu mchaawa mizabibu na kuikuwida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na agho masighariko gha wandu wa Juda ghichachurikia seji mudi ghuseragha miri na kuva matunda naighu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo kuchakaia na masighariko gha wandu kufuma Jerusalemu, ee, kufuma Mghondi ghwa Sioni, kuchakaia na masighariko gha wandu. BWANA wa majeshi uchabonya huwo, kwa wundu ghwa iriso uko najo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo, BWANA waghora huwu aighu ya mzuri wa Waashuru: ‘Ndechaacha andenyi ya muzi ughu, hata ndechaakumba iwanu aho, angu kucha na ngao, hata ndechaaghurughaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uchawuya kwa ija chia cheni orechieghe nayo, hata ndechaangia andenyi ya muzi ughu, waghamba BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia nichaghulindia muzi ughu na kughukira kwa wundu ghwapo na kwa wundu ghwa mdumiki wapo Daudi.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
